---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { profile } from "../data/profile";
---

<Base title="About — Varun Malhotra">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 pb-14 pt-24">
    <p class="label mb-6">About</p>
    <h1 class="max-w-3xl text-title font-medium leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.02em]">
      I started in GANs and ended up responsible for what an agent is allowed
      to do.
    </h1>

    <div class="mt-9 max-w-2xl space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
      <p>
        The through-line has been the same question in different clothes: how do
        you know the model is right? At Samsung it was image restoration you
        could judge by eye. At Michelin it is a natural-language interface to a
        pricing warehouse, where the answer looks equally plausible whether or
        not it is correct — and eyeballing it stops working.
      </p>
      <p>
        That is why most of what I build now is evaluation and guardrails rather
        than models. Benchmarks that exist before the system does, read-only
        enforcement that holds at every layer, gates that stop the agent when it
        is uncertain instead of letting it guess confidently.
      </p>
      <p>
        I am in Pune, three years into Michelin, and looking for work where the
        system has to hold up under real users rather than a demo.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Timeline -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 pt-10">
    <h2 class="mb-8 border-t border-line pt-6 text-heading font-medium">
      Trajectory
    </h2>
    <ol class="relative border-l border-line pl-8">
      {
        profile.roles.map((r) => (
          <li class="reveal relative pb-9 last:pb-0">
            <span
              aria-hidden="true"
              class:list={[
                "absolute -left-[35px] top-1.5 h-[11px] w-[11px] rounded-full border",
                r.current
                  ? "border-signal bg-signal"
                  : "border-line-bright bg-void",
              ]}
            />
            <p class="num mb-1 text-xs text-ink-dim">{r.dates}</p>
            <h3 class="text-base font-medium text-ink">{r.title}</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted">{r.company}</p>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>
  </section>

  <!-- Skills -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 pt-14">
    <h2 class="mb-8 border-t border-line pt-6 text-heading font-medium">
      Tools
    </h2>
    <div class="grid gap-px border border-line bg-line md:grid-cols-3">
      {
        profile.skills.map((g) => (
          <div class="bg-surface p-6">
            <p class="label mb-4">{g.group}</p>
            <ul class="space-y-1.5">
              {g.items.map((s) => (
                <li class="font-mono text-[13px] text-ink-muted">{s}</li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Education -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 pt-14">
    <h2 class="mb-8 border-t border-line pt-6 text-heading font-medium">
      Education
    </h2>
    <div class="panel p-7">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-3">
        <h3 class="text-base font-medium text-ink">{profile.education.school}</h3>
        <span class="num text-xs text-ink-dim">{profile.education.dates}</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-muted">{profile.education.degree}</p>
      <p class="num mt-1 text-sm text-signal">GPA {profile.education.gpa}</p>

      <div class="mt-6 border-t border-line pt-5">
        <p class="label mb-3">Certifications</p>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5">
          {
            profile.certifications.map((c) => (
              <li class="text-sm text-ink-muted">{c}</li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 pt-20">
    <div class="border border-signal/25 bg-signal/[0.04] p-9 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-heading font-medium text-ink">
        Hiring for agents, evaluation or LLM infrastructure?
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
        I reply to everything.
      </p>
      <a
        href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}
        class="mt-7 inline-block border border-signal bg-signal px-6 py-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-void transition-colors hover:bg-transparent hover:text-signal"
      >
        {profile.email}
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
